                "asynchronous_ai_overview": false,
                "markdown": "![Hebrew alphabet - letter chet gematria fence – Royalty-Free ...](https://api.dataforseo.com/cdn/i/10110523-2762-0139-0000-c33a498d0155:4)\nThe [Letter Chet](https://www.hebrew4christians.com/Grammar/Unit_One/Aleph-Bet/Chet/chet.html) is the `eighth letter of the Hebrew alphabet` (aleph-bet) and carries a numerical value of 8.[[1]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/137080/jewish/Chet.htm)\n\n### Key Details\n\n- **Symbol (Letter):** `ח` \n- **Numerical Value:** 8 (representing transcendence beyond the natural 7-day cycle)\n- **Pronunciation:** A deep guttural or throat-clearing \"ch\" sound, similar to the \"ch\" in the composer \"Bach\" (or like a hard \"h\").\n- **Ancient Pictograph:** Historically depicted as a tent wall or a fence, symbolizing protection and an enclosure.\n- **Modern Shape:** Resembles a doorway or an archway formed by a right vertical stroke (vav) and a left vertical stroke (zayin) connected by a thin top bridge (chatoteret).[[1]](https://www.hebrew4christians.com/Grammar/Unit_One/Aleph-Bet/Chet/chet.html)[[2]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/137080/jewish/Chet.htm)[[3]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nbWRjhLtX5E)[[4]](https://ephraimintheland.wordpress.com/2018/03/25/chet/)[[5]](https://objectivetranslation.home.blog/2019/05/20/the-amazing-biblical-language-the-importance-of-the-letter-chet/)[[6]](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Y0RYziB85a8)[[7]](https://inner.org/hebleter/chet.htm)\n\n### Symbolic & Spiritual Meanings\n\n- **Life (Chayim / Chai):** The letter forms the root of major Hebrew words related to life, vitality, and living (*chai*, *chayim*).\n- **Grace and Wisdom:** Associated with *chen* (grace) and *chokhmah* (wisdom).\n- **The Number Eight:** In Jewish tradition, 8 signifies a realm that transcends nature and time—such as a *brit milah* (circumcision) performed on the eighth day.[[1]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/137080/jewish/Chet.htm)[[2]](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/Y0RYziB85a8)[[3]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nbWRjhLtX5E)[[4]](https://www.hebrew4christians.com/Grammar/Unit_One/Aleph-Bet/Chet/chet.html)\n\nWould you like to explore **how Chet is written in cursive** , or learn about **other Hebrew letters** and their meanings?",
